  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de inversin en carreteras del Estado de Sao Paulo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sao Paulo State Road Investment Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sao Paulo State government requested the Bank&apos;s support to improve the road system and its integration with other transport modes. In order to do this, a rehabilitation and expansion of the capacity of approximately 1,600 km of roads will take place. This operation constitutes Phase I of the road investment program of the State of Sao Paulo (PIRSP by its Portuguese initials), that will need a total funding of US$S480,135,000 and will be implemented under a multiple works modality. This program requires funding for U$S S2,058.600. The Bank will be financing 70% of it (US$ 1,440,500) and local counterpart will finance the remaining 30% (US$ S681,100).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
